  data: {
    LLM: "First player (to dealer's right) draws top card, decides to keep or discard it, then may meld and must discard. Play proceeds counter-clockwise. Each turn: draw from stock or take entire discard pile; optionally meld or add to team melds; discard one card. First player to empty hand takes a morto (11-card extra hand). Second morto goes to first player of other team who runs out. Team can end play with second batida if they have a clean canastra (7+ cards without wild).",
    Player: "First player (to dealer's right) draws top card, decides to keep or discard it, then may meld and must discard. Play proceeds counter-clockwise. Each turn: draw from stock or take entire discard pile; optionally meld or add to team melds; discard one card. First player to empty hand takes a morto (11-card extra hand). Second morto goes to first player of other team who runs out. Team can end play with second batida if they have a clean canastra (7+ cards without wild).",
    objective: 'Be the first team to reach 3000 points by melding sequences, creating canastas (7+ card sequences), and going out. Score points from melded cards plus bonuses for canastas.',
    gameplay: "First player (to dealer's right) draws top card, decides to keep or discard it, then may meld and must discard. Play proceeds counter-clockwise. Each turn: draw from stock or take entire discard pile; optionally meld or add to team melds; discard one card. First player to empty hand takes a morto (11-card extra hand). Second morto goes to first player of other team who runs out. Team can end play with second batida if they have a clean canastra (7+ cards without wild).",
    keyRules: [
      '108 cards: 2 decks + 4 jokers; twos are wild',
      'Two 11-card mortos set aside for first players out',
      'Melds are sequences of 3+ consecutive cards of a suit',
      'Aces rank high and low: A-2-3-...-Q-K-A possible',
      'Max one wild card per sequence',
      'Canastra = sequence of 7+ cards (clean or dirty)',
      'Need clean canastra to go out',
      'Target: 3000 points',
